    'GPT5.6Luna(Max)V1': "Native WebGL2 has Kepler ellipses, a valid Moon, a belt and lock-on tracking. Distances are illustrative and initial phases do not represent a real epoch. Rings, glow and atmosphere are simplified, with no ACES. Selection does not zoom in automatically and several surface spins are reversed. Reset restores reference time and the camera.",
