    'GPT5.6TerraUltra-Three': {"title":"GPT-5.6 Terra (Ultra·Max) · Three.js Solar System","note":"Online Three.js implements date-driven elements, Kepler motion, Bloom/ACES and focus. Jupiter’s satellite configuration is overwritten by an array, so only one Moon is drawn, and its Euler-biased circle is invalid. Rings lack mutual shadows and atmosphere is rim lighting. Surface spin has an incorrect rate and continues while paused. Focus stops following after the transition; Now only restores the date.","issue":""},
